{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Don't Lose Aggro",
    "steam_appid": 3079160,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3079160/extras/e2b2705422b3997fd6c9602e7f09f99c.avif?t=1754349853\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   Protect your team by forcing enemies to attack you in this single-player action roguelite inspired by MMO raids. Create unique builds, unlock powerful talents and master the art of tanking to command the chaos!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Hold your foes' attention</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Damage your enemies to hold their attention! Or force them to attack you by running away! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't Lose Aggro lets you play any kind of tank you can think of, focusing on control, strategy and positioning.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Your Companions<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3079160/extras/ab267173ee1342a7ca54f7705918fbfd.avif?t=1754349853\" width=800 height=450 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have the assignment of protecting your group from harm!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Companions, while alive, provide powerful abilities that can be upgraded, which are key for a successful run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't Lose Aggro allows you to choose whether to protect your companions or go full hard-core and sacrifice them!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Abilities</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3079160/extras/72dcee018ec81fb4e6c8e9dd78649de7.avif?t=1754349853\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your abilities to utilize the tank you aim to become. Charge can close a gap between you and the enemy but if you're the slower type, you can always pull them towards you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some abilities are aggressive and focus on damage, whilst others focus on protection and healing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Progression</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3079160/extras/51a8eb41ecd192123d3800cfc6207780.poster.avif?t=1754349853\" width=576 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3079160/extras/51a8eb41ecd192123d3800cfc6207780.webm?t=1754349853\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3079160/extras/51a8eb41ecd192123d3800cfc6207780.mp4?t=1754349853\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your lasting tanking builds by spending talent points to suit your preferred playstyle. Play as a Dodger, Blocker, Kiter, or Taunter - each with distinct mechanics and upgrade paths.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Game World</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle through the lava-surrounded Isle of Doom, survive the Cyclone Sands' sandstorms, and face the final challenge in &quot;The Fallen City.&quot; </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you progress, you'll unlock new arenas and fight new enemies &amp; bosses to prove your tanking skills!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3079160/extras/e2b2705422b3997fd6c9602e7f09f99c.avif?t=1754349853\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   Protect your team by forcing enemies to attack you in this single-player action roguelite inspired by MMO raids. Create unique builds, unlock powerful talents and master the art of tanking to command the chaos!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Hold your foes' attention</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Damage your enemies to hold their attention! Or force them to attack you by running away! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't Lose Aggro lets you play any kind of tank you can think of, focusing on control, strategy and positioning.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Your Companions<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3079160/extras/ab267173ee1342a7ca54f7705918fbfd.avif?t=1754349853\" width=800 height=450 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have the assignment of protecting your group from harm!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Companions, while alive, provide powerful abilities that can be upgraded, which are key for a successful run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't Lose Aggro allows you to choose whether to protect your companions or go full hard-core and sacrifice them!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Abilities</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3079160/extras/72dcee018ec81fb4e6c8e9dd78649de7.avif?t=1754349853\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your abilities to utilize the tank you aim to become. Charge can close a gap between you and the enemy but if you're the slower type, you can always pull them towards you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some abilities are aggressive and focus on damage, whilst others focus on protection and healing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Progression</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3079160/extras/51a8eb41ecd192123d3800cfc6207780.poster.avif?t=1754349853\" width=576 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3079160/extras/51a8eb41ecd192123d3800cfc6207780.webm?t=1754349853\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3079160/extras/51a8eb41ecd192123d3800cfc6207780.mp4?t=1754349853\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your lasting tanking builds by spending talent points to suit your preferred playstyle. Play as a Dodger, Blocker, Kiter, or Taunter - each with distinct mechanics and upgrade paths.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Game World</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle through the lava-surrounded Isle of Doom, survive the Cyclone Sands' sandstorms, and face the final challenge in &quot;The Fallen City.&quot; </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you progress, you'll unlock new arenas and fight new enemies &amp; bosses to prove your tanking skills!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "Experience the thrill of MMORPG tanking in this single-player roguelite that lets you perfect your tanking skills without guild drama or 4-hour raid nights!",
